/sqletch
*.test

# coverage
*.out

# sqletch derived output under .sqletch/.
# NOTE: .sqletch/cache/ is deliberately NOT ignored — committing it is what
# keeps `check`/`generate`/the LSP offline. These two are regenerated from
# that cache by an offline `generate`, so they carry no information of their
# own.
**/.sqletch/explain/
**/.sqletch/expanded/

